    "chunk_text": "Butan tweon, lar is haligdomes d\u00e6l, & ealles swi\u00f0ost gif hio hyre gymeleste fram adrife\u00f0 & \u00e6lce So\u00f0lice sio lar mid geswince hio sceal \u00fea forenemnedan \u00feing for\u00f0bringan. Witodlice ealle Cristes \u00fea gecorenan \u00feurh geswinc & \u00feurh lare hie wurdon geweor\u00f0ode \u00fee we nu \u00deara w\u00e6s Abel on fyrm\u00fee middangeardes & o\u00f0er Noe. Ne m\u00e6g se rihtwisa man bion butan geswince gemang \u00feam unrihtwisan. Witodlice Noe ana w\u00e6s rihtwis betweox eall manna cyn, & he for his rihtwisnesse Gode licode. Ongita\u00f0 nu hw\u00e6t ic eow secge: gif ge nu bio\u00f0 geswencte, \u00fee swa manigra haligra manna m\u00e6genu to Ge\u00feenca\u00f0 nu hwylca \u00fea wyrda w\u00e6ron \u00e6r \u00f0am flode, & hwylce Abrahames forl\u00e6tu w\u00e6ron, & hu he his Gemuna\u00f0 eac hwylce ehtnesse Isac \u00e6ghwanon r\u00e6fnode, & hu he hyra \u00feeawe \u00feeowode & o\u00f0re men to Gemuna\u00f0 eac Iacobes m\u00e6nigfealdan geswinc. Be \u00f0am geswincum he w\u00e6s sprecende to Faraone & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Lytle syndon mine dagas & awyrgede. Ne becomon hy na to minra f\u00e6dera dagum. Ge\u00feencea\u00f0 eac Iosep & Moyses & iesunaue & Dauid & Eliam & Samuel & ealle \u00f0a halegan witegan, Hw\u00e6t, wene ge \u00fe\u00e6t ge m\u00e6gen \u00feurh idelnesse becuman to \u00f0\u00e6re biorhtnesse \u00fee Godes \u00fea gecorenan mid Butan twion ge magon",
